---
description: Flutter Riverpod code-generation state management
globs: flutter_app/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Use Riverpod with code generation only:
- riverpod_annotation
- riverpod_generator

Never suggest or introduce:
- Bloc
- Cubit
- GetX
- Provider-only state management
- service locators such as get_it

Follow the existing Riverpod patterns in the project.
Use the appropriate Riverpod provider type for the responsibility.

Do not put business logic inside widgets simply because Riverpod is available.
Avoid unnecessary providers. A provider must have a clear responsibility.

Keep presentation-specific state in the appropriate Riverpod layer.
Use Riverpod's selective watching and ref.listen when only a small section
needs to update.
